<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Poltek Group Employee Portal</title>

<style>

body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #f3f5f7;
    color: #222;
}

header {
    background: #123047;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 40px;
}

.logo {
    width: 140px;
    height: 80px;
    background: white;
    margin: auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #123047;
    font-weight: bold;
}

.company-section {
    background: white;
    padding: 30px;
    text-align: center;
}

.companies {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.company {
    background: #eee;
    width: 150px;
    height: 120px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
}

.employee {
    padding: 40px;
    text-align: center;
}

.card {
    background: white;
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 30px;
    border-radius: 15px;
    box-shadow: 0 5px 15px #ccc;
}

.timeline {
    padding: 40px;
}

.event {
    background: white;
    margin: 20px auto;
    max-width: 700px;
    padding: 20px;
    border-left: 6px solid #123047;
    border-radius: 10px;
}

button {
    background: #123047;
    color: white;
    padding: 15px 30px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 25px;
    font-size: 16px;
}

footer {
    background: #123047;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 20px;
}

</style>

</head>


<body>


<header>

<div class="logo">
POLTEK LOGO
</div>

<h1>Poltek Group</h1>

<p>Employee History Portal</p>

</header>



<section class="company-section">

<h2>Poltek Companies</h2>

<div class="companies">

<div class="company">Cryofoods Logo</div>

<div class="company">Company 2 Logo</div>

<div class="company">Company 3 Logo</div>

<div class="company">Company 4 Logo</div>

</div>

</section>




<section class="employee">

<h2>Employee Search Result</h2>


<div class="card">

<h2>Daniel Mawdesley</h2>

<p><b>Company:</b> Cryofoods</p>

<p><b>Length of Service:</b> 2 Years</p>

<p><b>Hours Per Week:</b> 30 Hours</p>

<p><b>Started Employment:</b> Age 16</p>


</div>


</section>




<section class="timeline">

<h2>Warehouse Timeline</h2>


<div class="event">

<h3>Year 1 - Warehouse Operative</h3>

<p>
Daniel started at Cryofoods working within warehouse operations.
Tasks included stock movement, order preparation and distribution support.
</p>

</div>


<div class="event">

<h3>Year 2 - Warehouse Experience Development</h3>

<p>
Developed experience with warehouse processes, teamwork,
organisation and daily operations.
</p>

</div>


</section>




<section style="text-align:center; padding:40px;">

<button>
Search Another Employee
</button>

</section>




<footer>

Poltek Group © 2026

</footer>


</body>
</html>
